<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:49:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>LKB1 失活引发 NNMT 介导的甲基汇并赋予肺癌对 PRMT5 的依赖性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/lkb1-inactivation-elicits-an-nnmtmediated-methyl-sink-and-confers-dependence-on-prmt5-in-lung-cancer</link><description>米等人。发现 LKB1 缺陷通过 NNMT 介导的“甲基汇”在肺癌中产生低效 PRMT5 状态。靶向 PRMT5 会触发 LKB1 缺陷癌细胞的衰老，并使其对 Navitoclax 等 senolytics 的脆弱性，代表一种有效的联合癌症疗法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/lkb1-inactivation-elicits-an-nnmtmediated-methyl-sink-and-confers-dependence-on-prmt5-in-lung-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:49:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/lkb1-inactivation-elicits-an-nnmtmediated-methyl-sink-and-confers-dependence-on-prmt5-in-lung-cancer</guid></item><item><title>人工智能分析手术技术以改善前列腺癌护理</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/ai-analyzes-surgical-technique-to-improve-prostate-cancer-care</link><description>西达-西奈研究人员表示，外科医生在手术中的动作（称为“手术手势”）可以用来预测患者的康复情况。他们的研究结果发表于&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-analyzes-surgical-technique-to-improve-prostate-cancer-care.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:34:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/ai-analyzes-surgical-technique-to-improve-prostate-cancer-care</guid></item><item><title>神经漫游者：从X开始：</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/neuromancer-from-on-x</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:19:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/neuromancer-from-on-x</guid></item><item><title>CRISPR使前列腺癌更容易受到免疫疗法的影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/crispr-makes-prostate-cancer-vulnerable-to-immunotherapy</link><description>保持 mRNA 的正常长度、更长的长度可以减少癌细胞产生的 SPSB1 蛋白的量。这使得 MHC-1 复合体得以回归。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/crispr-makes-prostate-cancer-vulnerable-to-immunotherapy.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:04:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/crispr-makes-prostate-cancer-vulnerable-to-immunotherapy</guid></item><item><title>在黑洞附近，引力改变了量子电路的读数，而不是它的规则</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/near-a-black-hole-gravity-changes-a-quantum-circuits-readings-not-its-rules</link><description>想象一下将我们最精确的量子设备之一固定在黑洞外的固定位置。约瑟夫森结（由超薄势垒隔开的两个超导体）可以以非凡的精度将电压转化为量子振荡。强烈的引力会改变量子规则，还是只会改变远处观察者读取设备的方式？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/near-a-black-hole-gravity-changes-a-quantum-circuits-readings-not-its-rules.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:49:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/near-a-black-hole-gravity-changes-a-quantum-circuits-readings-not-its-rules</guid></item><item><title>工程益生菌增强对胰腺癌的免疫攻击</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-boost-immune-attack-against-pancreatic-cancer</link><description>癌症免疫疗法已经改变了许多癌症的治疗方法，但胰腺癌仍然特别难以治疗。一个主要原因是胰腺肿瘤常常会产生一种“冷”的肿瘤微环境，肿瘤会阻止免疫细胞发起强烈攻击。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-boost-immune-attack-against-pancreatic-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:34:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-boost-immune-attack-against-pancreatic-cancer</guid></item><item><title>克利夫兰诊所研究将肠道微生物副产物与心律失常联系起来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/cleveland-clinic-study-links-gut-microbe-byproduct-to-heart-arrhythmia</link><description>克利夫兰诊所主导的一项研究表明，TMAO（氧化三甲胺）是肠道细菌消化红肉和其他动物产品中营养物质的副产品，血液中TMAO（氧化三甲胺）水平升高与心房颤动的较高风险之间存在联系。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cleveland-clinic-study-links-gut-microbe-byproduct-to-heart-arrhythmia.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:19:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/cleveland-clinic-study-links-gut-microbe-byproduct-to-heart-arrhythmia</guid></item><item><title>2025年日本平均预期寿命将上升</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/japans-average-life-expectancy-rises-in-2025</link><description>男性平均预期寿命81.35岁，比上年提高0.25岁。女性为87.33岁，增长0.2岁。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/japans-average-life-expectancy-rises-in-2025.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:04:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/japans-average-life-expectancy-rises-in-2025</guid></item><item><title>另一种 iPS 产品获准在日本提供公共保险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/another-ips-product-approved-for-public-insurance-coverage-in-japan</link><description>为卫生部长提供建议的中央社会保险医疗委员会周三批准了 RiHeart 的公共健康保险申请，RiHeart 是一种使用诱导多能干 (iPS) 细胞的心肌细胞片，于 9 月 1 日生效。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/another-ips-product-approved-for-public-insurance-coverage-in-japan.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 23:49:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/another-ips-product-approved-for-public-insurance-coverage-in-japan</guid></item><item><title>研究发现，工作记忆在分心后会迅速更新其优先顺序</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/working-memory-rapidly-updates-its-priorities-after-distractions-study-finds</link><description>当人类处理许多日常任务时，从驾驶到完成家务和工作任务，他们严重依赖工作记忆。这是大脑暂时存储和操纵重要信息的能力，有助于在不久的将来完成任务。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/working-memory-rapidly-updates-its-priorities-after-distractions-study-finds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 23:34:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/working-memory-rapidly-updates-its-priorities-after-distractions-study-finds</guid></item></channel></rss>